{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":304138,\"title\":\"The Dawn of Asia\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A TV drama consisting of thirteen episodes about the trans-China/Japan collaboration of revolutionaries in the early twentieth century. It was Nagisa Oshima’s rare attempt to direct a TV drama in a social atmosphere in which Japan was embracing postwar prosperity as well as the effects of permeating mass media. Making an effort to reach out to the mass audience through a seemingly conventional method of filmic representation, Dawn of Asia takes up the epic of trans-Asiatic solidarity while challenging nationalism on both sides.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ct0y8CKgOI8e6meaBA7rTR7MAr.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/OFagZrL9_xc/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1964,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":13,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"JNN\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"1965-03-13\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":46230,\"name\":\"Nagisa Ōshima\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7G4g7V3z5ultk05MaRWE0RvOLtW.jpg\"},{\"id\":1187647,\"name\":\"Shinsuke Mikimoto\",\"character\":\"Minetaro Nakayama\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s4dVVpEx2hsgcgi7nmUcxCk9S7C.jpg\"},{\"id\":552315,\"name\":\"Akiko Koyama\",\"character\":\"Yasuko Nakayama\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q8iwkok7FA2dbdes0m1pspIu0W.jpg\"},{\"id\":33730,\"name\":\"Kei Satō\",\"character\":\"Li Lie-jun\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xyb1DI4HViq1aEvc3pgJV5Xw2Sn.jpg\"},{\"id\":138748,\"name\":\"Rokkō Toura\",\"character\":\"Zhou Yu-Xian\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ucHF4SWobpjSKj2qkLZgkXPdM08.jpg\"},{\"id\":2521109,\"name\":\"Noriko Matsumoto\",\"character\":\"Yukiko Saeki\",\"photo\":\"https://im